                        "glosses": [
                            "A pronounced vertical ridge down the center of a breastplate, or rarely by extension a ridge on another item of armor."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8010353f-523a-4a5f-8473-caed90227bb8",
                                "sense_id": "05aac1f7-3236-3cc0-996e-f065377d11a5",
                                "text": "The convexity of the breast-plate, but more particularly its projecting tapul, […] the cone-like beevor, the pass-guards, and even the tapuls of the jambs and cuisses, are evidences of this fact."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b1cb2a4-f50c-450f-a45f-015d2eff5c5c",
                                "sense_id": "05aac1f7-3236-3cc0-996e-f065377d11a5",
                                "text": "Even to the time of his death (1643) the Black Mousquetaires of his house wore in the field complete armor, […] The breastplate has a ridge or \"tapul\" down the center with a marked projection near the lower edge."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
